#. Tag: title
#: man-apper-appsetup.1.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#. Tag: para
#: man-apper-appsetup.1.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid "Apper is the &kde; interface for PackageKit"
msgstr "Apper je  &kde; sučelje za PackageKit"

#. Tag: para
#: man-apper-appsetup.1.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Apper is able to manage packages, applications and updates in a cross-"
"distribution way thanks to the PackageKit project."
msgstr ""
"Apper je u stanju da upravlja paketima, aplikacijama i nadogradnjama u više-"
"distribucijskom načinu zahvaljujući za PackageKit projektu."

#. Tag: para
#: man-apper-appsetup.1.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is providing Linux users a single application that they can learn and use "
"in whatever distribution they are."
msgstr ""
"Ovo pruža korisnicima Linuxa da nauče iz jedne aplikacije i da je mogu "
"koristite gdje god da su."

#. Tag: para
#: man-apper-appsetup.1.docbook:50
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This small helper application provides a GUI interface for the distro-"
"agnostic Limba application installer, which makes it possible to install "
"Limba packages using Apper."
msgstr ""
"Ova mala pomoćna aplikacija pruža GUI interfejs za distro-neovisan Listaller "
"instaler aplikacija, što čini mogućom instalaciju Listaller paketa "
"koristećiApper."

